Add admin support dashboard (prompt 3 of 3)

New page: AdminSupportDashboard.tsx replaces the basic legacy support
page at /admin/support (legacy preserved at /admin/support-legacy).

Ticket management:
- Stat cards: awaiting admin, in progress, AI resolution rate, total open
- Filter pills by status and priority
- Ticket cards with priority dots, status badges, AI indicators
- Slide-out detail panel with full conversation thread
- Inline status/priority dropdowns that update immediately
- AI draft generation for suggested responses
- Reply form with internal note toggle
- Admin notes (not visible to user)
- Mark Resolved action

Knowledge base manager:
- Article list with published/draft badges
- Create/edit modal with title, category, summary, content, tags
- Toggle publish/unpublish
- Delete with confirmation dialog

CSS additions in design-system.css for ticket cards, internal note
messages, detail panel, and KB row styles.
